; Routing nests: an inner route overrides for its subtree, and the outer one
; resumes after it. This is the shape a drawing can now show.
; expect: calls 3
; expect: clean
; expect: answers
(/ ollama:llama3.2:3b
   ("Answer with exactly the word: outer"
    (/ ollama:llama3.2:3b "Answer with exactly the word: inner")
    "Answer with exactly the word: after"))
